    "body": "Quick pass (orchestrating session): merges cleanly with main; the author's gate (quick fell back to the batch tier for the Cargo change: every debug suite except the slow ones, the ui suites, clippy on all eight crates - 0 failed) was green on head e15910b3; body complete, `Fixes #828`. Flagged ready for the full review. For the reviewer and the maintainer: `camcraft-post` now depends on `camcraft-tools` (an internal workspace crate, no external dependency) - a crate-layering decision; the default holder feeds the collision checks for NEW tools only, so this is under the safety floor (high-tier review); the camcraft-mcp skill doc is not updated for the new `holder` argument (a process file - follow-up owed); no UI test covers the new editor fields.",
